msgid "Understanding FEN"
msgstr "理解 FEN"

msgid "FEN (Forsyth–Edwards Notation) is the standard text format for a chess position. ChessFEN uses it to pass positions between board images, PGN games, and rendered boards."
msgstr "FEN（Forsyth–Edwards 记谱法）是国际象棋局面的标准文本格式。ChessFEN 用它在上传棋盘图、PGN 对局与渲染图片之间传递局面。"

msgid "Piece placement"
msgstr "棋子摆放段"

msgid "A FEN string starts with the piece placement: eight ranks from rank 8 down to rank 1, separated by /."
msgstr "FEN 字符串以棋子摆放段开头：从第 8 横排到第 1 横排共 8 段，用 / 分隔。"

msgid "Uppercase letters stand for White pieces (K, Q, R, B, N, P) and lowercase letters for Black pieces. Digits encode runs of empty squares."
msgstr "大写字母表示白方棋子（K、Q、R、B、N、P），小写字母表示黑方棋子；数字表示连续空格的个数。"

msgid "That is the starting position."
msgstr "这就是初始局面。"

msgid "The other five fields"
msgstr "其余五个字段"

msgid "A complete FEN adds five space-separated fields: the side to move (w or b), castling rights (KQkq, or - for none), an en passant target square (or -), the halfmove clock, and the fullmove number."
msgstr "完整 FEN 还会追加五个以空格分隔的字段：走子方（w 或 b）、易位权（KQkq，无则 -）、吃过路兵目标格（无则 -）、半回合计数与回合数。"

msgid "ChessFEN distinguishes the first field as a Placement from the six-field Full FEN. A picture can only reveal where the pieces stand, so recognition returns a Placement; the side to move is chosen by the caller and the remaining fields default to - - 0 1."
msgstr "ChessFEN 把第一个字段称为棋子摆放段（Placement），把六字段的完整串称为完整 FEN。图片只能反映棋子位置，因此识别返回棋子摆放段；走子方由调用方选择，其余字段固定为 - - 0 1。"

msgid "Where ChessFEN uses FEN"
msgstr "ChessFEN 中的 FEN"

msgid "Recognition reads a board image and returns its Placement, with a per-square breakdown."
msgstr "识别读取棋盘图片并返回棋子摆放段，附逐格明细。"

msgid "PGN navigation exports the Full FEN after any half-move."
msgstr "PGN 导航可导出任意半步之后的完整 FEN。"

msgid "Rendering turns any syntactically valid FEN into a board image."
msgstr "渲染把任意语法合法的 FEN 变成棋盘图片。"

msgid "Try the renderer"
msgstr "试用渲染工具"

msgid "Understanding PGN"
msgstr "理解 PGN"

msgid "PGN (Portable Game Notation) records chess games as text: tag pairs describe the game, and the moves are written in Standard Algebraic Notation."
msgstr "PGN（Portable Game Notation）以文本记录国际象棋对局：标签对描述对局信息，着法使用标准代数记谱。"

msgid "Tags and moves"
msgstr "标签与着法"

msgid "A game begins with tag pairs in square brackets, followed by the moves in numbered pairs — White's move, then Black's."
msgstr "一局棋以方括号中的标签对开头，随后是按回合编号的着法——白方先走，黑方随后。"

msgid "Moves, half-moves and plies"
msgstr "回合、半步与 ply"

msgid "Each numbered move contains up to two half-moves, or plies. White's Nth move ends at ply 2N-1 and Black's Nth move at ply 2N; ply 0 is the initial position."
msgstr "每个回合最多包含两个半步（ply）。白方第 N 步结束于 ply 2N-1，黑方第 N 步结束于 ply 2N；ply 0 是初始局面。"

msgid "ChessFEN lets you pick exactly that half-move and exports the resulting Full FEN."
msgstr "ChessFEN 允许精确选择该半步，并导出对应的完整 FEN。"

msgid "Mainline and variations"
msgstr "主线与变例"

msgid "Parentheses contain variations — alternative lines that were considered but not played. ChessFEN follows only the mainline and ignores variations; a PGN document with unparseable games is rejected so that no wrong position is served."
msgstr "括号中是变例——考虑过但未实际走的替代线路。ChessFEN 只沿主线、忽略变例；只要文档中存在无法解析的对局，整份 PGN 都会被拒绝，以免返回错误局面。"

msgid "Several games in one file"
msgstr "一个文件中的多局"

msgid "A PGN document may contain many games. ChessFEN lists them all so you can choose one, then jump to any half-move."
msgstr "一个 PGN 文档可包含多局。ChessFEN 会全部列出供你选择，然后跳转到任意半步。"

msgid "Try PGN navigation"
msgstr "试用 PGN 导航"

msgid "About ChessFEN"
msgstr "关于 ChessFEN"

msgid "ChessFEN is a small, self-hostable tool for chess encodings: recognize a position from a board image, browse PGN games and export Full FENs, and render any Placement or Full FEN as a board image. It runs on CPU, ships as one Docker image, and offers the same features through a web interface and an API."
msgstr "ChessFEN 是一个可自托管的轻量工具：从棋盘图片识别局面、浏览 PGN 对局并导出完整 FEN、把任意棋子摆放段或完整 FEN 渲染成棋盘图片。它只依赖 CPU，以单个 Docker 镜像发布，并通过网页界面与 API 提供同样能力。"

msgid "Star the project"
msgstr "给项目点星"

msgid "If ChessFEN is useful to you, a star on GitHub helps others find it."
msgstr "如果 ChessFEN 对你有用，GitHub 上的一个 star 能帮助更多人发现它。"

msgid "Star on GitHub"
msgstr "在 GitHub 上加星"

msgid "Self-deploy"
msgstr "自部署"

msgid "Release images are published to GHCR (ghcr.io/sidnelyzhang/chessfen) and Docker Hub (&lt;DOCKERHUB_USERNAME&gt;/chessfen), with the recognition model baked in. If the GHCR package is private, run docker login ghcr.io first. Run one with Docker:"
msgstr "发布镜像已发布到 GHCR（ghcr.io/sidnelyzhang/chessfen）与 Docker Hub（&lt;DOCKERHUB_USERNAME&gt;/chessfen），识别模型已内置。若 GHCR 包仍为私有，请先执行 docker login ghcr.io。用 Docker 运行："

msgid "The repository also ships a docker-compose.yml for the published image: copy .env.example to .env, set ADMIN_PASSWORD and SECRET_KEY, then run docker compose up -d. Add docker-compose.build.yml to build from source instead."
msgstr "仓库还提供面向已发布镜像的 docker-compose.yml：把 .env.example 复制为 .env 并设置 ADMIN_PASSWORD 与 SECRET_KEY，然后运行 docker compose up -d；使用 docker-compose.build.yml 可改为源码构建。"

msgid "Then open http://localhost:8000 and create API keys on the admin page. The container serves plain HTTP: publish its port only to your reverse proxy, and set FORWARDED_ALLOW_IPS to the proxy address so rate limiting sees real client IPs. Set DATABASE_URL to use PostgreSQL instead of the SQLite volume."
msgstr "然后打开 http://localhost:8000，在管理页创建 API 密钥。容器只提供 HTTP：请把端口只暴露给你的反向代理，并把 FORWARDED_ALLOW_IPS 设为代理地址，以便限流识别真实客户端 IP；把 DATABASE_URL 指向 PostgreSQL 即可替代 SQLite 卷。"

